  "description": "As a devoted servant of Artemis, the nymph Daphne has taken a vow of maidenhood and pledged to never give her heart to a man. However, she finds her loyalty to her goddess shaken when she meets Apollo and is instantly mesmerized, feeling things she had sworn never to feel. As Daphne falls into temptation, she finds herself helpless against the chaotic whims of the gods. Will her transgression lead to true love? Or will the consequences of breaking her vow be more severe than she ever imagined?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
